  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Sheema Haiden vs State Of Kerala on 11 April, 2024 Author: Bechu Kurian Thomas Bench: Bechu Kurian Thomas In The High Court Of Kerala At Ernakulam Present The Honourable Mr. Justice Bechu Kurian Thomas Thursday, the 11th day of April 2024 / 22nd Chaithra, 1946 Crl.Mc No. 3116 Of 2024 Crime No.0/0 Of , St 3536/2022 Of Judl. Magi. Of First Class-Iii, Kottayam Petitioner(S)/Accused No.7: Sheema Haiden, Aged 41 Years, W/O Haiden, Kanichai House, Kudakuthukunnu, Mala, Thrissur District, Pin-680732 Respondent(S)/State & Complainant: 1. State Of Kerala, Represented By Public Prosecutor, High Court Of Kerala, Ernakulam, Pin- 682031 2. The Food Safety Officer, Kottayam Circle, Office Of The Food Safety Officer Kottayam Circle 1St Floor, Block Panchayath Office Building, Vadavathoor P.O. Kottayam, Pin-686010 This Criminal Misc. case coming on for orders, upon persuing the petition and upon hearing the arguments of M/S.Sruthy K.K, P.M.Rafiq, M.Revikrishnan, Ajeesh K.Sasi, Sruthy N. Bhat, Rahul Sunil, Nikita J. Mendez, Nanditha S. & Sohail Ahammed Harris P.P., Advocates for the petitioner and of Addl.Director General Of Prosecution, Addl. State Public Prosecutor & Public Prosecutor for R1 , the court passed the following: BECHU KURIAN THOMAS, J ------------------------------------------- Crl.M.C.No.3116 of 2024 ------------------------------------------- Dated this the 11th day of April, 2024 ORDER",
    "facts": "It is pointed out that, in the body of the memorandum of Crl.M.C, it is stated that, Annexure-3 is a revised list of food additives issued in the year 2023 and according to him, there is no such list issued in the said year.",
    "arguments": ""
  },
